/-!
# A256308

Apply the transformation 0 -> 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4 -> 5 -> 6 -> 7 -> 0 to the digits of n written in base 8; do not convert back to base 10.

The 60 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

